---
/* Brand marks as inline SVG.
 *
 * Inline rather than a sprite, a font or files in public/: six icons at ~500
 * bytes each is smaller than the request that would fetch them, and it keeps
 * working with no network and no icon system to maintain. `currentColor`
 * means the mark inherits whatever the card or the pill is already doing,
 * including on hover, with no second rule.
 *
 * FlashFX has no published wordmark to use here, so it takes a bolt. If a real
 * mark ever exists, this is the only place it has to change.
 */
